.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
CPP-API: Class to handle file I/O for C++\&. 

Derive an own implementation from this interface to provide custom IO handling to the \fBImporter\fP\&. If you implement this interface, be sure to also provide an implementation for \fBIOSystem\fP that creates instances of your custom IO class\&. 
